---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cale Dansbee — Technology Consultant | Dansbee Designs"
  description="25+ years in systems engineering and cybersecurity. Helping small and medium businesses build secure, modern technology stacks — M365, cybersecurity, AI implementation, and more."
>

  <!-- ── HERO ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-teal-darkest">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,var(--color-teal-accent)_0%,transparent_60%)] opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,var(--color-teal-deep)_0%,transparent_70%)]"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-28 md:py-40 text-center">
      <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-amber mb-6">
        Technology Consulting &amp; Contracting
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-tight leading-none mb-6">
        Dansbee Designs
      </h1>
      <div class="accent-bar-h mx-auto mb-8"></div>
      <p class="font-badge text-base md:text-lg text-cream/75 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-12">
        A husband-and-wife consulting practice with 25+ years in systems engineering and cybersecurity — helping small and medium businesses build the technology stacks they need to compete and grow.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:cale@dansbeedesigns.com"
          class="inline-block font-badge text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber text-teal-darkest px-8 py-4 hover:bg-amber-light transition-colors"
        >
          Start a Conversation
        </a>
        <a
          href="#services"
          class="inline-block font-badge text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-amber/50 text-amber px-8 py-4 hover:border-amber hover:bg-amber/10 transition-colors"
        >
          View Services
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── SERVICES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="services" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber mb-3">What I Do</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white uppercase">Services</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

      <!-- IT Strategy -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">IT Strategy &amp; Roadmapping</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Assess your current technology landscape, identify gaps, and build a practical roadmap aligned with your business goals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Executive Tech Leadership -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Executive Technology Leadership</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Acting as fractional CIO, CTO, or CISO — providing senior-level technology leadership to plan, implement, and govern your technology strategy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cybersecurity -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Cybersecurity Auditing &amp; Hardening</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Identify vulnerabilities in your infrastructure and implement targeted security measures to protect your business and data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- AI Implementation -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 .74-.4 1.39-1 1.73V7h1a7 7 0 0 1 7 7h1a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1H2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a7 7 0 0 1 7-7h1V5.73A2 2 0 0 1 10 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">AI Implementation</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Integrate practical AI tools and automation into your business workflows — cutting overhead and surfacing insights that drive better decisions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Website Design -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Website Design &amp; Hosting</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Professional websites designed, built, and hosted — fast, secure, and purpose-built for your business.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Consulting & Contracting -->
      <div class="group border border-amber/20 bg-amber/5 p-7 hover:border-amber/50 hover:bg-amber/10 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Consulting &amp; Contracting</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          Flexible engagements — whether you need an outside expert to assess and advise, or hands-on contracting to get it built.
        </p>
      </div>


      <!-- AI Champions -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 1 1 7.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0 0 14 18.469V19a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">AI Champions</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          We help teams discover, understand, and confidently adopt AI tools — turning curiosity into capability and capability into competitive advantage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Business Process Optimization -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="10" width="11" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="17" width="7" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M17 14l2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Business Process Optimization</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          We map, analyze, and streamline the workflows that run your business — reducing friction, eliminating bottlenecks, and freeing your team to focus on what matters most.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Knowledge & Data Management -->
      <div class="group border border-teal-mid/30 bg-teal-deep/20 p-7 hover:border-amber/40 hover:bg-teal-deep/40 transition-all">
        <div class="mb-4 text-amber">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v4c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 9v4c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V9"/><path d="M3 13v4c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3v-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Knowledge &amp; Data Management</h3>
        <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 leading-relaxed">
          We build systems that capture, organize, and surface your organization's knowledge and data — turning scattered information into a strategic asset.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── ABOUT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="about" class="bg-teal-deep/20 border-y border-teal-mid/20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-14 items-start">

        <!-- Credentials column -->
        <div>
          <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber mb-6">Background</p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="border border-teal-mid/40 bg-teal-deep/40 px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-light">Experience</p>
              <p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white mt-0.5">25+ Years</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-teal-mid/40 bg-teal-deep/40 px-4 py-3">
              <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-light">Focus Areas</p>
              <p class="font-badge text-xs text-cream/70 mt-1 leading-relaxed">IT Strategy · Cybersecurity · Executive Leadership · AI Implementation · Business Process Optimization · Knowledge Management</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bio column -->
        <div>
          <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber mb-6">About</p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white uppercase leading-tight mb-6">
            Dansbee Designs
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 font-badge text-sm text-cream/75 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Dansbee Designs is a husband-and-wife consulting practice built around one core idea:
              small and medium businesses deserve the same quality of technology infrastructure as the big players —
              without the enterprise price tag or the jargon.
            </p>
            <p>
              We've spent decades working hands-on with business owners to assess their needs, untangle their technology
              debt, and build practical roadmaps that actually get executed. That means hardening networks against modern threats, standing up websites and hosting, and increasingly — helping
              businesses find the right places to integrate AI.
            </p>
            <p>
              We work as both consultants and contractors. Sometimes you need an expert to assess and recommend.
              Sometimes you need someone to roll up their sleeves and build it. We do both.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── CONTACT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section id="contact" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24 text-center">
    <p class="font-badge text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-amber mb-4">Let's Talk</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white uppercase mb-6">
      Ready to Get Started?
    </h2>
    <p class="font-badge text-sm text-cream/65 max-w-md mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Whether you're assessing a problem, planning a project, or just need a second opinion — reach out and let's figure out the right path forward.
    </p>
    <a
      href="mailto:cale@dansbeedesigns.com"
      class="inline-block font-badge text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-amber text-teal-darkest px-10 py-4 hover:bg-amber-light transition-colors"
    >
      cale@dansbeedesigns.com
    </a>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .accent-bar-h {
    width: 60px;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-amber) 0%, var(--color-teal-mid) 100%);
  }
</style>
